  "description": "*“What role did I play in this novel? I want to know what kind of relationship I had with Chae Seung-Yeon.”*\n\nSeung-Yeon is possessed by the father of the obsessive maniac in the run-down BL novel written by his younger sister. Woo-Jin, the father of the main character, saves Seung-Yeon when he is in danger of death. Seung-Yeon realizes that he and Woo-Jin are in-laws, but as time passes, their relationship somehow flows differently from the original story…\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
